
anchor Prompt_3b1e8cff4f89be38:
    userPrompt:
        We also need a queue of messages so we can still send things when a harness is working.  We should be able to cancel items if they haven't been sent.
        
        I'd also like you to pin the prompt message as a header to the top of the chat history while it's working.  I think that's where you can put the queue as well -- a sort of expanding list dealio.
        
        And while you're at it, let's add a toggle that allows us to pick between automatically doing the next item in the queue or waiting.  Pending prompts should be persisted in the .suspense directory much like prompt history.
